@k.words.ge.noun.1 k.words.sense word=Ge pos=noun n=1 gloss="a brittle grey crystalline element that is a semiconducting metalloid (resembling silicon) used in transistors; occurs in germanite and argyrodite" synonym=germanium synonym="atomic number 32" is_a="chemical element" is_a=semiconductor core.source="wordnet 3.1"
